1. h3 d5 2. a3 e5 3. c4 dxc4 4. e3 Be6 5. Qc2 Nc6 6. Nf3 Be7 ({Basman mentions the murky line} 6... Na5 7. Nxe5 Nb3 8. Ra2 c3 9. Nxc3 Nxc1 10. Qxc1 Bxa2 11. Nxa2 {as giving him compensation, the vicious point being} Qd5 12. d4 Qxa2 $2 13. Bc4 {)}) 7. Bxc4 Bxc4 8. Qxc4 f5 9. d4 $1 e4 10. Ne5 Nxe5 11. dxe5 c6 12. Nc3 Qa5 13. Qe6 Nh6 14. b4 Qc7 15. Bb2 Rd8 16. O-O Rd2 17. Rab1 Qd7 18. Qb3 Qd3 19. Rbd1 Qc2 20. Qe6 $1 Qxb2 21. Rxd2 Qxd2 22. Rd1 Qxc3 23. Rd7 Ng8 24. Rxb7 Qc1+ 25. Kh2 Qd2 26. Rb8+ Qd8 27. Rxd8+ Kxd8 28. Qf7 {Source: Mike Basman opening book ('Creepy Crawly'). Contributed by Andy Ansel, 13 July 2021.} 1-0

